{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gelli Fields is a farming roguelike with a laid-back atmosphere that lets you go at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/f0146e4b02199263230c6fb0933da20d.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continaa is being taken over by a dark corruption that harms the nature around it. De-stress in the real world while you clean a digital one! Whether you like to farm, fish, or get rich, Gelli Fields has plenty of activities that create relaxing gameplay in your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/20da510999368509cd9c013cbb748ffd.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Continaa is split up into biomes, each with their own crops, activities, and gameplay. Each biome you play is a &quot;run&quot; and after every run you start back from scratch. But you don't lose everything! Your money is converted into star rank which you can spend on upgrades that improve quality of life, or give you powerful new abilities. There's 4 highly re-playable biomes handcrafted with love and filled with personality with many more to come later.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/bf889e7bc215db267811f6c63f8c6cc0.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase some seeds, harvest them, and sell them to afford higher quality seeds. Not into sitting around watching crops grow? grow them faster by clicking near them! As you get better at farming you'll Eventually grow\u00a0<strong>Legendary Crops</strong>\u00a0that would make any farmer jealous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/aef98c30ff07fd9edd631fce46f9c5e4.poster.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/aef98c30ff07fd9edd631fce46f9c5e4.webm?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/aef98c30ff07fd9edd631fce46f9c5e4.mp4?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/acbd7658553ffc3ca60415c58fa84bd0.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6ef8e72fa3b248650e4caf040221d060.poster.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6ef8e72fa3b248650e4caf040221d060.webm?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6ef8e72fa3b248650e4caf040221d060.mp4?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah, <strong>Gellis.</strong> These little guys are filled to the brim with magic energy and they'll eat anything you offer them. After a good meal they'll be more than happy to offer help in unique ways like conjuring a pile of coins, or attacking the corruption. There's over 15 species to discover and learn about. Which one'll be your favorite?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/cc971d5c46067bc25140e3cd53992082.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We all need time to kick back and relax, right? Well there's no shortage of fun activities to do in this game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish</strong><br>Watch bodies of water for shadows and reel in to see what you catch! Each biome has their own fish and with upgrades like the fishing net and bait there's tons of fun for the aspiring fisherman.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch bugs</strong><br>There's over 20 different bugs to catch from common, to rare, all the way to legendary ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate</strong><br>Between every run you return your train station to get upgrades and select your next biome. But what fun is a train station if you can't decorate it? Unlocks tons of furniture and let your creativity run wild as you make your station yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.poster.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.webm?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.mp4?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/54e7173b350cede2dc41bfa7f7afddac.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run awards you with <strong>star rank.</strong> Spend it on global upgrades to unlock new features like an expanded backpack, being able to harvest multiple crops at once, and starting off with a rare mystery item. Love a particular biome? Each one has their own upgrade category to expand on the gameplay and make runs much quicker. Eventually you'll be able to farm star rank directly in each biome to unlock <strong>Master Upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d661349f660a1c8063ad7c0ef74b.poster.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d661349f660a1c8063ad7c0ef74b.webm?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d661349f660a1c8063ad7c0ef74b.mp4?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gelli Fields is a project that comes from the heart. Thank you so much for checking this out.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/4b4208bd1dac22cbaf864784832c6b92.avif?t=1770946203\" width=613 height=220 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/