 it? Unlocks tons of furniture and let your creativity run wild as you make your station yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.poster.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.webm?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/1ae43914e79e650c5ae557baf1bda6b2.mp4?t=1770946203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/54e7173b350cede2dc41bfa7f7afddac.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run awards you with <strong>star rank.</strong> Spend it on global upgrades to unlock new features like an expanded backpack, being able to harvest multiple crops at once, and starting off with a rare mystery item. Love a particular biome? Each one has their own upgrade category to expand on the gameplay and make runs much quicker. Eventually you'll be able to farm star rank directly in each biome to unlock <strong>Master Upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d661349f660a1c8063ad7c0ef74b.poster.avif?t=1770946203\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965980/extras/6866d6